&lt;p&gt;In both cases, tukituki writes individual process logs to &lt;code&gt;.tukituki/logs/&lt;/code&gt; as usual, and you can inspect them with &lt;code&gt;tukituki logs &amp;lt;name&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt; at any time.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>